{"unit_id":"rison114514__dsh-image-understanding#feature-1","repo":"rison114514/dsh-image-understanding","commit":"0cc031bc43b8ec3643c5f173b8e7424ba3f0a5d9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-understanding 的功能「自动识别上传图片」：上传图片进入 agent/pre-step 后，插件读取附件并发送给 qwen-vl，把识别结果替换成文本消息供 DeepSeek 回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin.js:137-159","plugin.js:217-233"]}
